===persian===

ای ابرِ عابر...
از ماه بگذر...
بی مهتاب...
سایه‌ها می‌میرند...
شعر چوپانیم را در دشت خواندم...
شبان... گوسفندانش را رها کرد...
پونه‌ها را بویید...
آنقد گریه کرد... تا... بی‌مهتاب به خواب رفت...
۱۳۷۱/۱/۲۹

===machine===

O passing cloud...
move off the moon...
Without moonlight...
the shadows die...
I sang my shepherd's poem out on the plain...
The shepherd... let his sheep go...
He smelled the pennyroyal...
He wept so long... that... he fell asleep with no moonlight on him...
1371/1/29

===lantern===

O passing cloud —
get off the moon.
Without moonlight
the shadows die...
I sang my shepherd's poem out on the plain.
The shepherd let his sheep go,
smelled the pennyroyal,
and wept so long
that he fell asleep with no moonlight on him...

1371/1/29

